    <div class="intro">
      <h3 style="color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;">🎿 Day 13 Overview</h3>
      <p>Thursday brings another packed programme with ten medal events as the Games enter their final stretch. The men's slalom delivers two thrilling runs on the Stelvio in Bormio, the biathlon mixed relay combines men and women in a tactical team shootout at Anterselva, the bobsled two-man crowns its champion in the final runs at Cesana, freestyle skiing men's slopestyle lights up Livigno, the cross-country men's 4×10km relay is the sport's team crown jewel at Tesero, speed skating women's 1500m tests middle-distance brilliance, short track men's 500m decides its gold in an explosive sprint, and figure skating women begin their short programme in Milan.</p>
    </div>

