        <li>Bobsled Two-Man Final (Runs 3 &amp; 4) — Friedrich seeks three-peat at Cesana</li>
        <li>Freestyle Skiing Men's Slopestyle Final at Livigno</li>
        <li>Cross-Country Men's 4×10km Relay — Norway vs Sweden at Tesero</li>
        <li>Speed Skating Women's 1500m — middle-distance gold at Barentsburg Arena</li>
        <li>Short Track Men's 500m Final — explosive sprint in Milan</li>
        <li>Figure Skating Women's Short Programme at Milano Forum</li>
        <li>Curling — Semifinal Round at Cortina</li>
        <li>Ice Hockey — Preliminary Round continues</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

